OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FA murky start to the day in the 
OL,6,Fnorth with low cloud and light rain,   
OL,7,Fbrighter elsewhere to start before     
OL,8,Fcloud and rain gradually sink          
OL,9,Fsouthwards. Feeling cooler than        
OL,10,FWednesday.                             
OL,12,CTonight:FRain eases overnight with low 
OL,13,Fcloud in the south. Towards the north, 
OL,14,Fcloud will lift into the early hours,  
OL,15,Fwith temperatures staying above        
OL,16,Ffreezing.                              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
