OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy to begin with, but      
OL,6,Flifting and breaking into the          
OL,7,Fafternoon, bringing bright and even    
OL,8,Fsunny spells across the north and east 
OL,9,Finto the afternoon. Temperatures       
OL,10,Faround the November average.           
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA very 
OL,13,Fcold start to Saturday but it will be  
OL,14,Fbright and sunny through the day.      
OL,15,FTurning cloudier on Sunday and Monday  
OL,16,Fwith the odd spot of rain once again.  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
